{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.ColorCurveQIntegerForm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorCurveQIntegerForm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QIntegerFactorial"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColorCurveQIntegerForm.colorSpectralCubic_coeff_ladder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorCurveQIntegerForm.colorSpectralCubic_coeff_ladder","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCurveQIntegerForm.lean#L81-L87","doc":"**Coefficient q-integer ladder.** Consecutive coefficients differ by a pure power\nof `z`: `[k+1]_z = [k]_z + z^k` (`qInt_succ`). So the four coefficients\n`[1]_z, [2]_z, [3]_z, [4]_z` form a q-integer ladder — the functional-equation\nstructure through which the base q-shift `z ↦ q·z` acts on `Σ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColorCurveQIntegerForm.colorSpectralCubic_qInt_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorCurveQIntegerForm.colorSpectralCubic_qInt_form","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCurveQIntegerForm.lean#L70-L79","doc":"**q-integer form (named, over a `Field`).** `C_z(X) = [1]_z·X³ + [2]_z·X² +\n[3]_z·X + [4]_z`, reusing the corpus quantum integer `QOU.MathlibExt.qInt z k = [k]_z` (the\ngeometric one — see the disambiguation note above). The color\nspectral curve is a **q-integer curve** — the structural handle for lifting the base\nq-shift to `Σ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColorCurveQIntegerForm.colorSpectralCubic_geomSum_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorCurveQIntegerForm.colorSpectralCubic_geomSum_form","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCurveQIntegerForm.lean#L60-L68","doc":"**q-integer form (over any `CommRing`).** The cubic's coefficients are the\ntruncated geometric sums `∑_{i<k} z^i` for `k = 1,2,3,4` — i.e. `C_z` is\n`∑_{k=1}^{4} (∑_{i<k} z^i)·X^{4−k}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColorCurveQIntegerForm.colorSpectralCubic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorCurveQIntegerForm.colorSpectralCubic","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCurveQIntegerForm.lean#L55-L58","doc":"**The color spectral cubic** `C_z(X) = X³ + (z+1)X² + (z²+z+1)X + (z³+z²+z+1)`\n(`def:color-spectral-cubic`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}